Netflix Project – Agile Project Plan
Challenge 1: What Makes Content Popular on Netflix?
1. Sprint Goal
Deliver a complete Netflix content popularity analysis that identifies key characteristics of popular titles and presents clear insights through visualizations and a final report by the end of the sprint.

2. Team & Roles
Role	Owner	Responsibilities
Data Lead	Partner A	Data loading, cleaning, EDA, insights
Visualization & Docs Lead	Partner B	Charts, notebook documentation, README, final report polish
Shared	Both	Code review, conclusions, Git commits, retrospective
