T3	Data Cleaning	Handle any missing values, duplicates, data type issues	Partner A	To Do	High
T4	Feature Engineering	Create derived metrics (e.g. watch count per movie, avg rating per movie, genre popularity)	Partner A	To Do	High
T5	Exploratory Data Analysis	Explore distributions, correlations, top genres, year trends	Partner A	To Do	High
